# ==============================================================================
# FAZZTRACK FINANCE DASHBOARD - SELF-HOSTED STATIC WEB APP
# ==============================================================================
#
# This application is 100% client-side and local-first.
# All financial transactions, accounts, budgets, and portfolio assets are stored
# directly in browser localStorage. No database server or login credentials are required.
#
# Build command:
#   npm run build
#
# Static deployment:
#   Serve the generated ./dist folder using Caddy, Nginx, or any static file server.
#
# Optional environment variables:
#   (None required for core operations)
